(1049,2210,'A variant of bullous erythema multiforme. It ranges from mild skin and mucous membrane lesions to a severe, sometimes fatal systemic disorder. Ocular symptoms include ulcerative conjunctivitis, keratitis, iritis, uveitis, and sometimes blindness. The cause of the disease is unknown.','en',2,'2026-06-24 20:27:01',NULL,NULL,'7720FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
